	spec: 'Identifiers, file names, comments, docs and tasks use US English spelling (color, center, gray, neighbor, behavior, canceled, labeled, summarize, catalog, license); tasks/README.md states the convention. Persisted record fields and protocol names follow it too (answer and transition canceled, TurnStatus canceled): there is no compatibility code for older histories, whose cancelled flags are now ignored (a canceled answer reads as an empty one). Quoted outside text (API values, third-party names) keeps its own spelling.',
